w22-revision-selectivity
------------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code, data or
weights.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Yupeng Tang and Mingfeng Lin.
"When Expert Disagreement Hurts: Prestige and Selectivity in LLM Decision
Revision". arXiv:2611.16694, v1, submitted 12 Nov 2026. Primary category
cs.AI, cross-listed cs.CL. Comments field: "Accepted at NeurIPS 2026".
