Method only: the idea of a two-pass audit in which only the revision context
varies (neutral reflection, anonymous disagreement, expert-attributed
disagreement) over a frozen initial answer, and of judging revision by
which initial answers it reverses rather than by reversal counts. The
prestige-blind citation policy, the declared fixture threshold for a help
claim, the oracle and the fixtures are this sketch's own; the paper's own
selectivity bar is not imported. No text, figures, tables or data from the
paper are copied into the code; the PDF was not read; no model was run.
The paper's claims appear only in paper_evidence.json, quoted and marked
UNVERIFIED.
